# r0 != 0, so cbz falls through to the trap: the run ends in mt_trap(MT_TRAP_UDF) at its
# address and the movs after the label is not reached.
title: the trap instruction (udf #0xfe) stops with MT_TRAP_UDF at its address
ref: A8.8 UDF T1 (clang's trap is udf #254); ADR 0014: udf/bkpt/svc become MT_TRAP_UDF

[code]
00b1        cbz r0, skip
fede        trap
skip:
0121        movs r1, #1
7047        bx lr

[in]
r0 = 1

[out]
trap = udf BASE+2
